This file describes the major changes and reorganisations only. Small feature 
or API changes are described in the changelogs for individual files.

Version 0.1:
- first release


Version 0.2:
- Single VW library split into several libraries so that VWCore has few 
  depends.

Version 0.3:
- Incorporation of reduced version of VNL into source tree to avoid the need 
  for a complete VXL download just to compile VWCore.
- VW-isation of VNL. VNL classes and functions now reside in VNL namespace and
  are capitalised. eg. vnl_matrix_fixed<x,x,x> becomes VNL::MatrixFixed<x,x,x>.
  (Note that the reduced VNL source has identical functionality, but no longer
  depends on vcl,vsl and other parts of the vxl project, and instantiates 
  slightly fewer types of matrix etc, so that the resulting library is 
  marginally smaller.)
- Seperation of the GL tools into a seperate library.